<svg viewBox="0 0 560 634" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
  <!-- Source: worked example with a toy corpus of 4 passages, not a measurement.
       Bar scale for word weights: linear, weight 1.20 = 300px, so 0.36 = 90px. Bars start at x = 16. -->
  <text class="d-t d-sm" x="16" y="22">Word ranking (BM25): rare words count more</text>

  <rect class="d-box" x="16" y="34" width="528" height="64" />
  <text class="d-t d-sm" x="32" y="58">Toy corpus: 4 passages (N = 4)</text>
  <text class="d-t d-mono" x="32" y="84">query: worker effort</text>

  <text class="d-t d-b" x="16" y="130">Step 1. Weigh each query word</text>

  <text class="d-t d-sm" x="16" y="162">"worker" appears in 3 of 4 passages</text>
  <rect class="d-box" x="16" y="172" width="90" height="24" />
  <text class="d-t d-mono" x="114" y="190">0.36</text>

  <text class="d-t d-sm" x="16" y="226">"effort" appears in 1 of 4 passages</text>
  <rect class="d-yellow" x="16" y="236" width="300" height="24" />
  <text class="d-t d-mono" x="324" y="254">1.20</text>

  <text class="d-t d-mono" x="16" y="296">idf = ln((N - n + 0.5)/(n + 0.5) + 1), N = 4</text>
  <text class="d-t d-sm" x="16" y="318">n = passages that contain the word. The weight is idf.</text>

  <text class="d-t d-b" x="16" y="360">Step 2. Rank the passages</text>

  <rect class="d-yellow" x="16" y="374" width="528" height="92" />
  <text class="d-t d-t-dark d-b" x="32" y="400">1st</text>
  <text class="d-t d-t-dark d-mono d-b" x="88" y="400">## Effort</text>
  <text class="d-t d-t-dark d-mono" x="88" y="424">Workers run at medium effort.</text>
  <text class="d-t d-t-dark d-sm" x="88" y="450">Both words. Heading and title words count 2x.</text>

  <rect class="d-box" x="16" y="478" width="528" height="40" />
  <text class="d-t d-b" x="32" y="504">2nd</text>
  <text class="d-t d-mono" x="88" y="504">The worker reads the packet.</text>
  <text class="d-t d-sm" x="528" y="504" text-anchor="end">worker only</text>

  <rect class="d-box" x="16" y="528" width="528" height="40" />
  <text class="d-t d-b" x="32" y="554">3rd</text>
  <text class="d-t d-mono" x="88" y="554">A worker returns a short report.</text>
  <text class="d-t d-sm" x="528" y="554" text-anchor="end">worker only</text>

  <rect class="d-box" x="16" y="578" width="528" height="40" />
  <text class="d-t d-b" x="32" y="604">4th</text>
  <text class="d-t d-mono" x="88" y="604">Each worker has its own folder.</text>
  <text class="d-t d-sm" x="528" y="604" text-anchor="end">worker only</text>
</svg>
